# The working directory is the node directory. MESSAGES.RA is in %ELEBBS% or %RA%.
# Optional fallback when EXITINFO.BBS is not in the node directory.
# EleBBS selects the conference. This door reads that one area.
# A trailing word sets the area type: local, echo, netmail, or email.
# area General=C:\elebbs\msgs\general echo
#
# editor= is ExternalEdCmd when CONFIG.RA does not set one.
# The editor is started with the COM port, baud, minutes left, and timeout.
# The editor reads msginf (from, to, subject, number, area, private)
# and saves the finished text as msgtmp in the node directory.
# editor=C:\elebbs\editor.exe
# download=C:\elebbs\dsz.exe sz %F
